crystal balls could be named universal detection. they can, i believe, detect
food, objects, monsters a/o gold. when applied, you have to specify what you
want to see: $ means gold, % means food, ! means objects (or you could use
any other object symbol) and m will do for monsters (again any monster symbol).
it seems that after the first use the vision is often unclear. i haven't
found an essential use for a crystal ball yet ...

